Nova Worker Beta
================

This repository contains a modified version of the Worker from:

  edgetunnel — https://github.com/cmliu/edgetunnel
  Copyright (C) the edgetunnel authors
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (GPL-2.0)

Modifications made in this repository:

  * User-agent identity strings renamed from "edgetunnel" to "Nova Worker Beta"
    (subscription fetch user-agent, BEST_SUB client detection, subconverter
    user-agent). No other logic in `_worker.js` was changed.
  * Added deployment configuration (`wrangler.toml`), a one-click install page
    (`install/index.html`), and a GitHub Actions deployment workflow.

The complete corresponding source is this repository. See LICENSE for the full
text of GPL-2.0.
